## What NOT to do in tests

Never assert on exact prose content — scene output is non-deterministic.
Never chain Test 2 output from Test 1 output — tests must be independent.
Never skip the KG fixture — workers will return character_node_found: false.
Never pass empty context dicts — workers will return need_input or fail silently.
Never use chapter_context=0 for gardener-plotting-system — use a chapter > 0
  where your fixture data was seeded.
